---
// Offer in Compromise hero with topic background and subtle dark overlay
---

<section id="service-hero" class="relative bg-dark-background py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0">
    <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/34862508/pexels-photo-34862508.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200"
      srcset="https://images.pexels.com/photos/34862508/pexels-photo-34862508.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=320 320w, https://images.pexels.com/photos/34862508/pexels-photo-34862508.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=640 640w, https://images.pexels.com/photos/34862508/pexels-photo-34862508.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1024 1024w, https://images.pexels.com/photos/34862508/pexels-photo-34862508.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1920 1920w"
      sizes="100vw"
      alt="Offer in Compromise - Tax Settlement Agreement"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-35"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/85 via-black/70 to-black/85"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8">
    <nav class="text-gray-300 text-[14px] mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition">Home</a>
      <span class="mx-2 text-gray-500">/</span>
      <a href="/services/audit-help" class="hover:text-white transition">Tax Services</a>
      <span class="mx-2 text-gray-500">/</span>
      <span class="text-white font-medium">Offer in Compromise</span>
    </nav>

    <span class="inline-block bg-[#C1272D] text-white font-medium text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider px-3 py-1 rounded-[6px] mb-4">
      Tax Settlement Options
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-[40px] lg:text-[56px] font-bold text-white font-serif leading-[1.1] mb-4 max-w-[950px]">
      Offer in Compromise Defense
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[18px] lg:text-[22px] text-gray-200 italic max-w-[850px] leading-relaxed">
      The IRS Offer in Compromise is an established legal method to settle past-due tax debts with the IRS for less than owed.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
